' Question: where does a new kind of bot plug in?
' Explained by: ../05-building-blocks.md. Drawn by hand, high level.
@startuml 05-kind-seam
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
[the shell of every kind\n(runner, store, use cases)] as SH
[BotKindCatalog] as C
[GridKind] as GK
[GridExecutorFactory] as GF
[a second kind\n(EPIC-040G)] as K2
SH --> C : IBotKindCatalog.kind(kind_id)
C --> GK : IBotKind
C ..> K2 : IBotKind (Planned)
GK --> GF : executor_factory()
@enduml
